<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Risper & Geoffrey's Love Story</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@400;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Raleway:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #fef7f7; overflow-x: hidden; }
        header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fad0c4 100%); height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; color: white; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .header-image { width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 50%; border: 5px solid white; margin-bottom: 30px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #666; font-style: italic; }
<img src="https://i.imgur.com/jwiP1gf.jpeg" alt="Risper and Geoffrey photo" width="400">
        .header-image i { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .hearts { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1; }
        .heart { position: absolute; width: 20px; height: 20px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); transform: rotate(45deg); opacity: 0; animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
        .heart:before, .heart:after { content: ''; width: 20px; height: 20px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; }
        .heart:before { top: -10px; left: 0; } .heart:after { top: 0; left: -10px; }
        @keyframes float { 0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(45deg); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateY(-100px) rotate(45deg); opacity: 0; } }
        .header-content { z-index: 2; max-width: 800px; padding: 0 20px; }
        h1 { font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 4.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); }
        .subtitle { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 300; }
        .couple-names { font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-top: 10px; color: #ff6b6b; }
        .scroll-down { position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 2rem; animation: bounce 2s infinite; cursor: pointer; }
        @keyframes bounce { 0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(-50%); } 40% { transform: translateY(-20px) translateX(-50%); } 60% { transform: translateY(-10px) translateX(-50%); } }
        section { padding: 100px 20px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .meeting { background-color: white; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); border-radius: 10px; padding: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
        h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center; color: #ff6b6b; }
        .story-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .story-text { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
        .story-image { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; height: 300px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #666; font-style: italic; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
        .story-image i { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .love-now { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd 0%, #c2e9fb 100%); color: white; border-radius: 10px; padding: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
        .love-now h2 { color: white; }
        .qualities { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .quality { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); padding: 25px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }
        .quality i { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; }
        .gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .gallery-item { height: 200px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #666; font-style: italic; }
        .gallery-item i { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .gallery-item:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .timeline { position: relative; max-width: 800px; margin: 50px auto; }
        .timeline::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 6px; background-color: #ff9a9e; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 50%; margin-left: -3px; }
        .timeline-item { padding: 10px 40px; position: relative; width: 50%; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) { left: 0; } .timeline-item:nth-child(even) { left: 50%; }
        .timeline-content { padding: 20px 30px; background-color: white; position: relative; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-content::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 20px; height: 20px; right: -10px; background-color: white; top: 15px; border-radius: 50%; z-index: 1; }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-content::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 20px; height: 20px; left: -10px; background-color: white; top: 15px; border-radius: 50%; z-index: 1; }
        .timeline-date { font-weight: bold; color: #ff6b6b; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        footer { background-color: #333; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px; margin-top: 50px; }
        .love-quote { font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { h1 { font-size: 3rem; } .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; } .header-image { width: 150px; height: 150px; } .couple-names { font-size: 2rem; } .timeline::after { left: 31px; } .timeline-item { width: 100%; padding-left: 70px; padding-right: 25px; } .timeline-item:nth-child(even) { left: 0; } .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-content::after, .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-content::after { left: 21px; right: auto; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="hearts" id="hearts"></div>
        <div class="header-content">
            <div class="header-image"><i>💑</i><div>Risper & Geoffrey</div></div>
            <h1>Our Love Story</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">A serendipitous meeting that blossomed into unconditional love</p>
            <p class="couple-names">Risper & Geoffrey</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-down" onclick="scrollToSection('meeting')">↓</div>
    </header>
    <section id="meeting" class="meeting">
        <h2>How We Met</h2>
        <div class="story-container">
            <div class="story-text">
                <p>It was a day like any other, until fate decided to intervene. I was at [location] when our eyes met across the room. There was an instant connection, something I'd only read about in books or seen in movies.</p>
                <p>We started talking, and hours felt like minutes. There was an ease between us that was unexpected yet so natural. We shared stories, dreams, and laughter that filled the space around us.</p>
                <p>Neither of us was looking for love that day, but sometimes the best things in life happen when you least expect them. That random encounter turned out to be the beginning of our beautiful journey together.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-image"><i>❤️</i><div>Photo from when Risper & Geoffrey first met</div></div>
        </div>
        <h2>Our Journey</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-content"><div class="timeline-date">First Meeting</div><p>The day Risper and Geoffrey's paths crossed and their story began.</p></div></div>
            <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-content"><div class="timeline-date">First Date</div><p>Their official first date where they discovered shared interests and values.</p></div></div>
            <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-content"><div class="timeline-date">Becoming Official</div><p>The moment they decided to make their relationship official.</p></div></div>
            <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-content"><div class="timeline-date">Today</div><p>Their love continues to grow stronger with each passing day.</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="love-now">
        <h2>Our Unconditional Love</h2>
        <div class="story-container">
            <div class="story-text">
                <p>What started as a chance encounter has blossomed into a deep, unconditional love that continues to amaze us both. We've built a relationship based on trust, respect, and genuine care for one another.</p>
                <p>Through challenges and celebrations, we've stood by each other, growing individually and as a couple. Our love isn't perfect, but it's real - full of understanding, forgiveness, and unwavering support.</p>
                <p>We've learned that unconditional love means accepting each other completely - flaws and all - and choosing each other every single day, no matter what life brings our way.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-image"><i>💑</i><div>Recent photo of Risper & Geoffrey</div></div>
        </div>
        <h2>What Makes Our Love Special</h2>
        <div class="qualities">
            <div class="quality"><i>💖</i><h3>Trust</h3><p>We have complete faith in each other and our relationship.</p></div>
            <div class="quality"><i>🤝</i><h3>Support</h3><p>We're each other's biggest cheerleaders in all endeavors.</p></div>
            <div class="quality"><i>😄</i><h3>Laughter</h3><p>We find joy in the simplest moments together.</p></div>
            <div class="quality"><i>🗣️</i><h3>Communication</h3><p>We talk openly and honestly about everything.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="memories">
        <h2>Our Memories</h2>
        <div class="gallery">
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 1</div></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 2</div></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 3</div></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 4</div></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 5</div></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><i>📷</i><div>Memory 6</div></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <footer>
        <p class="love-quote">"In you, I've found the love of my life and my closest, truest friend."</p>
        <p>Made with ❤️ by Risper for Geoffrey</p>
    </footer>
    <script>
        function createHearts() { const heartsContainer = document.getElementById('hearts'); const heartCount = 15; for (let i = 0; i < heartCount; i++) { const heart = document.createElement('div'); heart.classList.add('heart'); const left = Math.random() * 100; const size = Math.random() * 20 + 10; const delay = Math.random() * 5; const duration = Math.random() * 3 + 3; heart.style.left = `${left}%`; heart.style.width = `${size}px`; heart.style.height = `${size}px`; heart.style.animationDelay = `${delay}s`; heart.style.animationDuration = `${duration}s`; heartsContainer.appendChild(heart); } }
        function scrollToSection(sectionId) { document.getElementById(sectionId).scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' }); }
        window.onload = function() { createHearts(); };
    </script>
</body>
</html>
